      "cooked": "<p>When I view an item, the Valuation shows as 0.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/0/e0372baaa96bc95606952299473abe9fb2d38c46.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e0372baaa96bc95606952299473abe9fb2d38c46\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e0372baaa96bc95606952299473abe9fb2d38c46_2_690x218.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"vZv9EQAgUHkZCnvELuBEFgWj4J8\" width=\"690\" height=\"218\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e0372baaa96bc95606952299473abe9fb2d38c46_2_690x218.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e0372baaa96bc95606952299473abe9fb2d38c46_2_1035x327.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/0/e0372baaa96bc95606952299473abe9fb2d38c46.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1E1E1E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1057×334 23.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>On Stock Entry, we did give this item a value.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/f/7f7360d87e9e73f7042184d8081b9b9db7a0bd1e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7f7360d87e9e73f7042184d8081b9b9db7a0bd1e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/f/7f7360d87e9e73f7042184d8081b9b9db7a0bd1e_2_690x75.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ibtPO88WLuQGtLLGI58ivYbPX7E\" width=\"690\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/f/7f7360d87e9e73f7042184d8081b9b9db7a0bd1e_2_690x75.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/f/7f7360d87e9e73f7042184d8081b9b9db7a0bd1e_2_1035x112.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/f/7f7360d87e9e73f7042184d8081b9b9db7a0bd1e.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"222222\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1036×113 10.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>This is behavior normal or is it a bug? If it’s normal and intended, how do you add Valuation Rate so that it would show after stock entry?</p>",
