      "id": 476572,
      "username": "guimorin",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2025-08-07T00:31:26.702Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This field is misleading.</p>\n<p>It does not represent the current valuation rate of the item based on stock transactions. Instead, it is a default valuation rate that is used during stock transactions, only if no other valuation data exists (e.g., if the item has no prior stock or transactions, no item prices, …).</p>\n<p>This field’s value is manually set and does not update automatically.</p>",
